# Held on disk, not in git (owner's decision, 2026-11-20): documents
# whose source shows no redistribution terms.  ../LIT_MANIFEST.md,
# SOURCES.tsv and SHA256SUMS list every file with its URL and SHA-256,
# so they can be fetched again and verified.  In git: only what came
# from the AIST-hosted ICOT archive (TR/TM, FGCS proceedings, Museum
# pages), which permits free academic use unchanged.
/ipsj/
/journals/
/records/
/web/*
!/web/www.airc.aist.go.jp/
/theses/
